ers more than the nearest date"}],[["$","p","The published 2026/27 master’s page contains different calls, revised dates and a later call for EU applicants and non-EU applicants residing in Italy. A student abroad who needs a visa cannot assume that the next visible deadline is available to them.",{"children":"The published 2026/27 master’s page contains different calls, revised dates and a later call for EU applicants and non-EU applicants residing in Italy. A student abroad who needs a visa cannot assume that the next visible deadline is available to them."}],"$L1c"],"$undefined","$L1d","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23"]}],false,"$L24","$L25"]}],"$L26"]}]
